# Canonical host: www.portalaser.com
# Every request to the bare apex (http or https) gets a 301 to the www host.
# Cloudflare Pages serves this file at the site root and applies the rules.
https://portalaser.com/* https://www.portalaser.com/:splat 301
http://portalaser.com/* https://www.portalaser.com/:splat 301
